    "catalog:category": "sanitary",
    "catalog:placement": "free",
    "catalog:lod": "300",
    "catalog:format": "2",
    "catalog:tags": "shower, shower enclosure, quadrant, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Quadrant shower enclosure on a tray: rim 0.04. The back wall is on wallFace and the left side (-x) is a wall too; mirror the block for the other hand. The tray stands on a quarter cylinder sector of radius 0.90 about the corner of the walls; its floor and rim are outline sweep halves, the gully flush in a hole through the floor. Curved glass 0.010 on the rim: two fixed panels and a sliding door 0.002 inside them, not drawn in plan. A riser stands on the valve on its axis and carries the head.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Drafting standard key dimensions (practice, verify; EN 14527 for the tray), not read, unverified; quadrant of radius 0.90 filling the 0.90 x 0.90 footprint, generic, unverified; ports BS EN 12056-2 via the drafting standard, not read, unverified; height 2.00 practice size, unverified",
    "ifc:class": "IfcSanitaryTerminal",
    "ifc:predefinedType": "SHOWER",
    "ifcClass": "IfcSanitaryTerminal",
